    <h1 class="en">Overfitting Diagnosis and Robustness Validation for AI-Econometric Quantitative Models</h1>
    <h1 class="cn">AI计量模型过拟合判别与样本外稳健性检验</h1>

    <div class="meta en">Published: 2026 | Research: Model Validation, Quantitative Strategy, Econometric Stability</div>
    <div class="meta cn">发布时间：2026 | 研究方向：模型检验、量化策略、计量稳定性</div>

    <h2 class="en">Abstract</h2>
    <h2 class="cn">摘要</h2>

    <p class="en">Machine learning based quantitative models easily fit historical market noise excessively, resulting in excellent in-sample performance but failed out-of-sample practical application.</p>
    <p class="cn">基于机器学习构建的量化模型极易过度拟合历史市场噪声，出现样本内表现优异、实盘样本外完全失效的普遍问题。</p>

    <h2 class="en">1. Core Problem</h2>
    <h2 class="cn">1. 核心问题</h2>
    <p class="en">Financial data features low signal-to-noise ratio and non-repeatable market rules. Traditional training modes tend to regard random fluctuations as effective trading laws.</p>
    <p class="cn">金融数据具备低信噪比、规律不可复刻等特性，传统训练模式极易将随机波动当作有效市场规律进行学习。</p>

    <h2 class="en">2. Diagnosis System</h2>
    <h2 class="cn">2. 判别检验体系</h2>
    <ul class="en">
        <li>In-sample and out-of-sample performance deviation inspection</li>
        <li>Time rolling window verification and multi-cycle cross testing</li>
        <li>Extreme market environment adaptability assessment</li>
    </ul>
    <ul class="cn">
        <li>样本内外收益与波动偏差程度检测</li>
        <li>时序滚动窗口验证与多周期交叉检验</li>
        <li>极端行情环境下模型适配能力评估</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="en">Practical Significance</h2>
    <h2 class="cn">实践意义</h2>
    <p class="en">Standardized robustness verification can eliminate pseudo high-yield strategies caused by historical overfitting and make intelligent econometric research more practical.</p>
    <p class="cn">标准化稳健性检验体系能够剔除历史过拟合催生的伪高收益策略，让智能计量研究更加贴合真实市场运行逻辑。</p>

